  "clips": [
    {
      "id": "S01",
      "file": "S01.mp3",
      "text": "二零零零年七月一日，二十一岁英国空姐露西在东京六本木彻底失踪。",
      "sha256": "fc359d3fc09c2236929af960d90307e350246674d7d2c50c80b2eea2afdaf90c",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十三期）",
      "narration_id": "S01",
      "target_start": 0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 7.628,
      "atempo": 1.2713,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "file": "S02.mp3",
      "text": "几个月前她刚辞去英航工作，来东京打工攒旅费，却误入高级夜店。",
      "sha256": "70dbfb3de7778f7dbb5c6cbcafad48bd650b7af4f3c324697b29cd63196a00a6",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十三期）",
      "narration_id": "S02",
      "target_start": 6,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 7.419,
      "atempo": 1.2365,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "file": "S03.mp3",
      "text": "失踪当晚，露西兴奋地告诉朋友，有位熟客要买一部新手机送给她。",
      "sha256": "6cf3e85f9b7fd7b4bc2d020e9cdc244deb045104577c4a4b0ede30bc0e77e6f3",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十三期）",
      "narration_id": "S03",
      "target_start": 12,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.304,
      "atempo": 1.0507,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "file": "S04.mp3",
      "text": "随后她独自跟着这名男子前往海边，谁也没想到这是她最后一次露面。",
      "sha256": "71affaca79513f633d66a55baa9fa5cf2df220da15ede0479b86a6c30286faf4",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十三期）",
      "narration_id": "S04",
      "target_start": 18,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.8,
      "atempo": 1.1333,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "file": "S05.mp3",
      "text": "当晚露西曾用那部新手机打回电话，只说自己在海边，很快就会回来。",
      "sha256": "d5833731081573c4b249335a7cb45e07fa17a7ea05834831b83cbb4c44de5a29",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十三期）",
      "narration_id": "S05",
      "target_start": 24,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.304,
      "atempo": 1.0507,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "text": "可第二天、第三天过去，露西再也没有出现，手机也彻底关机。",
      "sha256": "c68eda23ab101e40a4d7db16aaaf5caf214b0e2a7dd8b2e392971b97f49cc226",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十三期）",
      "narration_id": "S06",
      "target_start": 30,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 7.21,
      "atempo": 1.2016,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "text": "焦急的家人从英国赶到东京，甚至惊动了英国首相出面敦促日方调查。",
      "sha256": "e688191c9c3547217da836db0f36a63fd3a0df223566357d5c477e5cc6ed0e3c",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十三期）",
      "narration_id": "S07",
      "target_start": 36,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 7.036,
      "atempo": 1.1726,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "text": "可起初警方进展缓慢，直到十月，警署突然收到一封署名露西的信。",
      "sha256": "e551e9a2f5762807e5c70428b80bd6681cd223c0c39ca02208a2e84f691d9859",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十三期）",
      "narration_id": "S08",
      "target_start": 42,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 7.5,
      "atempo": 1.25,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "text": "信里附着一万美金，声称自己已经离开日本，但这反而暴露了破绽。",
      "sha256": "28aa372f013d5325cd3d0b0f326a24b80281f81c9479509a78d0b4add68d08b1",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十三期）",
      "narration_id": "S09",
      "target_start": 48,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.223,
      "atempo": 1.0372,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "text": "警方认定这是凶手自导自演的障眼法，视线立刻锁定了富商织原城二。",
      "sha256": "bdab3131c0c0eb29ecb8db845bc9ea56ecc96e53a7e018aa624fb9b3b8013e39",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十三期）",
      "narration_id": "S10",
      "target_start": 54,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 8.104,
      "atempo": 1.3506,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "file": "S11.mp3",
      "text": "织原城二常混迹六本木，而露西失踪当晚那部新手机，正是他出面买下的。",
      "sha256": "5a06d70f73e25c488b338db292d58569404de37903bc469c08ead5edb2f1d01a",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十三期）",
      "narration_id": "S11",
      "target_start": 60,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 7.338,
      "atempo": 1.2229,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "file": "S12.mp3",
      "text": "警方调取了织原全部通话记录，终于在七月三日发现一段致命空白。",
      "sha256": "42a7433b229613865d566ad562232730ef99501fd49315db33a4462030449ce7",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十三期）",
      "narration_id": "S12",
      "target_start": 66,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.606,
      "atempo": 1.101,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "file": "S13.mp3",
      "text": "那天他在神奈川三浦市诸矶湾一带，整整七个小时没有打过一通电话。",
      "sha256": "2ff313a0f9ba822baee3c59fc5a104175a913cff0e9d34a2ee6c9eec91b8b595",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十三期）",
      "narration_id": "S13",
      "target_start": 72,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 7.802,
      "atempo": 1.3003,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "file": "S14.mp3",
      "text": "更可疑的是，他名下一栋海边别墅平时从不住人，当时却突然现身。",
      "sha256": "1aa3ba32aa37b32ffeb63b2bafc3185c5056901491a60fe3e1153b671c576dbc",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十三期）",
      "narration_id": "S14",
      "target_start": 78,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.432,
      "atempo": 1.072,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "file": "S15.mp3",
      "text": "管理员还曾目击他浑身是土，深夜里手里提着一把铁锹在附近走动。",
      "sha256": "ca3bf73073055860d16e5cd63c6499e736709849ee6989e89e22ae35571b2e39",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十三期）",
      "narration_id": "S15",
      "target_start": 84,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 7.21,
      "atempo": 1.2016,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S16",
      "file": "S16.mp3",
      "text": "警方立刻把搜索重心，压向这栋海边别墅方圆两三百米的海岸线。",
      "sha256": "f235a728906f9cd20d616f60c91f26378cf51061d5ccf1a09e59ecaf89929e77",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十三期）",
      "narration_id": "S16",
      "target_start": 90,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.223,
      "atempo": 1.0372,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S17",
      "file": "S17.mp3",
      "text": "二零零一年二月九日，距离露西失踪整整七个月，搜查终于有了结果。",
      "sha256": "189b72c696c44403df37d37bfc17a5cfc956d6022660dc5a53695d256f072d8d",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十三期）",
      "narration_id": "S17",
      "target_start": 96,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.734,
      "atempo": 1.1223,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S18",
      "file": "S18.mp3",
      "text": "就在距离织原别墅不到三百米的海蚀洞深处，警方找到了被藏匿的遗骸。",
      "sha256": "99598f9ad06db3d46854815d2df3bf1c64c1d2610cf0ee17ce3d7943a5d4ddc6",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十三期）",
      "narration_id": "S18",
      "target_start": 102,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.827,
      "atempo": 1.1378,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S19",
      "file": "S19.mp3",
      "text": "次日法医确认，这正是失踪七个月的英国空姐露西·布莱克曼。",
      "sha256": "6cfb3068b199b235c42eb54b570f50cad8f98a2e352cd6fea6c32cfe7d00ec69",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十三期）",
      "narration_id": "S19",
      "target_start": 108,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.606,
      "atempo": 1.101,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S20",
      "file": "S20.mp3",
      "text": "警方查明，织原长期利用药物侵害女性，并在别墅里偷拍犯罪过程。",
      "sha256": "174741ec1673bb23fe1827c63b8ba0459efeb8c4a94633b7e7a4a1e0fc69b4b4",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十三期）",
      "narration_id": "S20",
      "target_start": 114,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.908,
      "atempo": 1.1513,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S21",
      "file": "S21.mp3",
      "text": "然而进入法庭审理后，这起铁案却因为直接物证损毁而陷入漫长拉锯。",
      "sha256": "17810f28f0c5f5c2cff275547078ab2405d77577619eaca1cbdc162b6109ca83",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十三期）",
      "narration_id": "S21",
      "target_start": 120,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.827,
      "atempo": 1.1378,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S22",
      "file": "S22.mp3",
      "text": "织原城二矢口否认杀害露西，甚至在庭审前向露西父亲支付巨额赔款。",
      "sha256": "e5e4b7c5ced865bb2a48a86a8386f8bfa30740ae35455983fc5cb55f63bd1ca1",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十三期）",
      "narration_id": "S22",
      "target_start": 126,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.304,
      "atempo": 1.0507,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S23",
      "file": "S23.mp3",
      "text": "二零零七年一审宣判，法院竟以缺乏直接死因证据判他露西案部分无罪。",
      "sha256": "27c3a7096f1d25d4e752dbab42bda3819d8ca792fe40486bff5aa555b084de68",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十三期）",
      "narration_id": "S23",
      "target_start": 132,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.827,
      "atempo": 1.1378,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S24",
      "file": "S24.mp3",
      "text": "判决一出英日舆论哗然，检方当庭上诉，绝不接受这样的结果。",
      "sha256": "80429d244b1eac9eae082416ff439f9b4f78b987155c1d8dc864728093aedde5",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十三期）",
      "narration_id": "S24",
      "target_start": 138,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.304,
      "atempo": 1.0507,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S25",
      "file": "S25.mp3",
      "text": "二零零八年十二月二审终于改判，认定他对露西犯有强奸未遂与弃尸罪。",
      "sha256": "008273a0d7e842ff8b3b6d8b1aaa6586f4748b9709fcde3ed7cf7321acd92e09",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十三期）",
      "narration_id": "S25",
      "target_start": 144,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.908,
      "atempo": 1.1513,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S26",
      "file": "S26.mp3",
      "text": "二零一零年十二月，日本最高法院终审驳回上诉，维持无期徒刑判决。",
      "sha256": "d73a8bd6b29de4377897a53c900b12ccff374e1e6c2a474322fcb491501115e1",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十三期）",
      "narration_id": "S26",
      "target_start": 150,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.014,
      "atempo": 1.0023,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S27",
      "file": "S27.mp3",
      "text": "迟到十年的终审判决，虽然判处了无期徒刑，却再也换不回那个二十一岁女孩。",
      "sha256": "09a17d269768d657d88454ee2091e06ba626ddaef6ea87fc67400e5899b452a9",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十三期）",
      "narration_id": "S27",
      "target_start": 156,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.827,
      "atempo": 1.1378,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S28",
      "file": "S28.mp3",
      "text": "如果不是警方死盯那七小时的通话空白，海蚀洞里的秘密或许永远无人知晓。",
      "sha256": "7abd7e6aa3dfc84d94606abbb8dc3287b4d1741122ecde38fed77c153a4c45a3",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十三期）",
      "narration_id": "S28",
      "target_start": 162,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 7.117,
      "atempo": 1.1862,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S29",
      "file": "S29.mp3",
      "text": "一部新手机成了最后的坐标，也让再精密的伪装最终暴露在阳光下。",
      "sha256": "b76f7c828ecf914eb9cd3c4187ede2e06165ea69f53d2660209e29eb78b3bc64",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "voice_description": "悬疑纪录片向低沉普通话男声，克制压抑（沿用至第二十三期）",
